        a="Laptops move, so their faults move too. One that works at the office may not connect at home, or a dock that worked last week may stop after an update. Laptop support covers the device wherever it goes, with remote help for software issues and visits for docks and hardware.",
        x="Laptops that leave the office should be encrypted and backed up. If yours are not, that is the first thing we recommend.",
